<title>POLAND: Polish dwellings output down m/m 1.5 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Polish dwellings output down m/m 1.5 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in May fell 1.5 percent from April but was 16.6 percent higher than in May 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said 3,880 flats were completed in May bringing the</p>
<p>total for the January-May period to 20,928 flats.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	    MAY	  APRIL	 MAY 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	-1.5	9.0  (-8.2)     N.A</p>
<p> number of flats built	   3,880    3,940(3,975)    3,328</p>
<p>NOTE - Revised figures in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
